{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"12":{"eng-name":"Marriage (Kitab Al-Nikah)","ara-name":"كتاب النكاح"}},"section_detail":{"12":{"hadithnumber_first":2046,"hadithnumber_last":2174,"arabicnumber_first":2046,"arabicnumber_last":2174}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2086,"arabicnumber":2086,"text":"Ibn Az-Zubayr رضي الله عنه a rapporté d’après Umm Habibah رضي الله عنها qu’elle était l’épouse d’Ibn Jahsh, mais il est décédé. Il faisait partie de ceux qui avaient émigré en Abyssinie. Le Négus l’a alors mariée au Messager d’Allah ﷺ","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":12,"hadith":41},"chapter":{"id":20,"ara-name":"باب فِي الْوَلِيِّ","eng-name":"Regarding The Guardian","isFirstHadith":false}}]}